   "id": "depth-residual",
   "severity": "high",
   "note": "The building is modelled 7.72m deep. The design study states 8.0m. See the derivation: the study's own floor-area figure agrees with 7.72, but until someone measures it this is a 280mm question."
  },
  {
   "id": "beam-over-kitchen",
   "severity": "medium",
   "note": "Removing the wing's east wall to make one kitchen-diner needs a beam over a 3.0m span. Assumed, not designed."
  },
