   "id": "beam-over-master",
   "severity": "high",
   "note": "The master reaches north past the original rear wall, which means removing 3.35m of a load-bearing wall at first-floor level with the new roof over it. Assumed, not designed, and the most consequential structural assumption in this stage."
  },
